---
import { icon } from '../../lib/icons.js';
---

<section id="mobile" class="section">
  <div class="section-inner">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <div>
        <h2>Ahead on short mobile tasks, behind on tabletop and long tasks</h2>
      </div>
      <p>
        GPT-6-Astra leads on mobile, short-horizon tasks. Cross-group results show where that
        advantage holds and where specialized policies remain stronger.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div id="task-gap-analysis" class="insight-block">
      <h3>Task-level strengths and weaknesses</h3>
      <div class="report-prose">
        <p>
          GPT-6-Astra wins <strong>five tasks outright</strong> and ties for the lead on two more.
          It ranks second on five tasks, but sixth or seventh on six. Its task-averaged success rate
          places it second overall despite this uneven performance.
        </p>
        <p>
          <a class="appendix-link" href="#comparison" data-matrix-link="field">
            Compare task-level differences <Fragment set:html={icon('external-link')} />
          </a>
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div id="mobile-content"></div>
    <div id="cross-group-analysis" class="insight-block">
      <h3>Performance by operating mode, horizon and precision</h3>
      <p>
        The comparison groups tasks by operating mode, then examines horizon within mobile tasks and
        precision within tabletop tasks.
      </p>
      <div id="cross-group-chart"></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
